WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.077 --> 00:00:03.680
Terrell stood in the subway station with the other riders.

2
00:00:03.681 --> 00:00:07.029
Detective Smith was shining a flashlight on the tracks.

3
00:00:07.030 --> 00:00:12.692
"When can we get out of here?" a woman moaned.

4
00:00:12.693 --> 00:00:14.847
"I'm late for work."

5
00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:18.410
"Please be patient," Detective Smith said.

6
00:00:18.411 --> 00:00:21.621
"I have more questions about the robbery."

7
00:00:21.622 --> 00:00:24.821
"I wish Roxy was here," Terrell thought.

8
00:00:24.822 --> 00:00:28.183
"She could get my science project back in no time."

9
00:00:28.184 --> 00:00:30.393
Just then Roxy appeared.

10
00:00:30.394 --> 00:00:32.618
Terrell grinned.

11
00:00:32.619 --> 00:00:36.046
"Hey, Detective Smith," Roxy called.

12
00:00:36.047 --> 00:00:39.839
"What are you looking for—subway rats?"

13
00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:44.397
He frowned. "That's not funny, Rocket Girl.

14
00:00:44.398 --> 00:00:47.704
I'm actually looking for a subway spider."

15
00:00:47.705 --> 00:00:51.245
Terrell watched Roxy talk to Detective Smith for a few minutes.

16
00:00:51.246 --> 00:00:53.699
She was too far away to notice him.

17
00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:57.466
Finally Detective Smith pointed, and Roxy flew off.

18
00:00:57.467 --> 00:01:00.279
"Roxy will be back soon," Terrell thought.

19
00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:02.369
"Then I can go to the science fair."

20
00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:05.146
Terrell glanced to the right.

21
00:01:05.147 --> 00:01:08.261
Something was moving around in the dark subway tunnel.

22
00:01:08.262 --> 00:01:10.671
It was Black Spinneret!

23
00:01:10.672 --> 00:01:14.644
Terrell gulped. "I should tell Detective Smith.

24
00:01:14.645 --> 00:01:17.782
But if I do, Black Spinneret will get away.

25
00:01:17.783 --> 00:01:21.537
Hey! This might be a job for Danger Dude!"

26
00:01:21.538 --> 00:01:23.978
Terrell made sure no one was watching.

27
00:01:23.979 --> 00:01:26.783
He stepped closer to the tracks.

28
00:01:26.784 --> 00:01:33.742
Then he jumped down and ran after the villain.

29
00:01:33.743 --> 00:01:38.234
Black Spinneret darted through the tunnel.

30
00:01:38.235 --> 00:01:41.210
Terrell followed her to a door marked Danger.

31
00:01:41.211 --> 00:01:43.808
She slipped inside.

32
00:01:43.809 --> 00:01:46.349
Terrell peeked through a crack in the door.

33
00:01:46.350 --> 00:01:50.186
Inside a tiny room, Black Spinneret was dumping her sack.

34
00:01:50.187 --> 00:01:53.018
Stolen goods spilled all over the floor.

35
00:01:53.019 --> 00:01:56.685
"This must be her subway hideout," Terrell thought.

36
00:01:56.686 --> 00:01:59.567
The villain frowned as she looked at Terrell's project.

37
00:01:59.568 --> 00:02:01.898
"I don't want this junk!

38
00:02:01.899 --> 00:02:06.173
I quit my train conductor job to steal and get rich!"

39
00:02:06.174 --> 00:02:09.995
Terrell gasped as she kicked the device.

40
00:02:09.996 --> 00:02:13.293
A second later Black Spinneret threw open the door.

41
00:02:13.294 --> 00:02:15.925
Terrell hid behind it as she left.

42
00:02:15.926 --> 00:02:20.109
Then he hurried into the hideout.

43
00:02:20.110 --> 00:02:23.731
"Phew! My project is okay!"

44
00:02:23.732 --> 00:02:26.732
As Terrell stood up, he saw something.

45
00:02:26.733 --> 00:02:29.953
Large sheets of paper were taped to the wall.

46
00:02:29.954 --> 00:02:32.981
"Design plans," Terrell thought.

47
00:02:32.982 --> 00:02:35.321
"They're for Black Spinneret’s harness!

48
00:02:35.322 --> 00:02:40.981
Hmm. She moves her legs by sending them electrical signals.

49
00:02:40.982 --> 00:02:44.374
I wonder if . . ."

50
00:02:44.375 --> 00:02:47.878
Across the city, people in fancy clothes were at a garden party.

51
00:02:47.879 --> 00:02:50.627
It was on the roof of the Grand Metro Tower.

52
00:02:50.628 --> 00:02:54.132
Two long black legs gripped the edge of the rooftop.

53
00:02:54.133 --> 00:02:57.622
A second later the rest of Black Spinneret appeared.

54
00:02:57.623 --> 00:03:01.700
"Put up your hands, rich people!"

55
00:03:01.701 --> 00:03:04.243
She leaped onto a table.

56
00:03:04.244 --> 00:03:08.891
"This is a robbery!"

